WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.588
Llama runs AI models right on your Mac.

00:00:02.638 --> 00:00:04.346
It lives in your menu bar,

00:00:04.396 --> 00:00:07.166
and suggests models that fit your Mac.

00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:08.863
One click to download.

00:00:10.973 --> 00:00:12.250
Then open a chat.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.709
The model loads on its own.

00:00:15.727 --> 00:00:18.414
Your conversations never leave your computer,

00:00:18.464 --> 00:00:20.346
and it even works offline.

00:00:23.198 --> 00:00:27.446
And any app that speaks the OpenAI API can use it too.

00:00:28.439 --> 00:00:29.180
That's it.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.773
Your own AI, right on your own Mac.

00:00:31.773 --> 00:00:34.291
Head to llama.app and get it free.
